@startuml seq-user-registration
title <size:16><b>Sequence: Регистрация и активация продавца</b></size>\n<color:#555>UserRegisteredEvent → инициализация preferences; UserBecameSellerEvent → SellerReadModel</color>

skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor #455A64
    FontColor #1C2833
}
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    BorderColor #2E7D32
    FontColor #1B5E20
}
skinparam queue {
    BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    BorderColor #6A1B9A
}
skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #EDE7F6
    BorderColor #6A1B9A
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #FBC02D
    FontColor #4E342E
    BorderThickness 1.2
    roundcorner 6
}
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    ArrowThickness 1.4
    LifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
    BoxBorderColor #B0BEC5
    BoxBackgroundColor transparent
    DividerBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
    DividerBorderColor #90A4AE
    GroupBorderColor #78909C
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
    GroupHeaderFontColor #263238
    GroupHeaderFontSize 12
}

actor       "Пользователь"            as User
participant "API Gateway\n:5000"      as GW   #ECEFF1
participant "IdentityService\n:5001"  as IS   #EBF5FB
participant "CatalogService\n:5002"   as CS   #E8F5E9
participant "NotificationService\n:5005" as NS #E0F7FA
participant "AnalyticsService\n:5006" as AS   #FFF3E0
queue       "RabbitMQ"                as MQ   #F3E5F5
database    "PostgreSQL\npublic"      as PGIS #EBF5FB
database    "PostgreSQL\nnotifs"      as PGNS #E0F7FA
database    "PostgreSQL\ncatalog"     as PGCS #E8F5E9

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Регистрация нового пользователя ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

User -> GW : POST /api/users\n{email, password, firstName, lastName,\n birthDate, gender, isSeller, lat?, lon?}
GW   -> IS : публичный эндпоинт (AllowAnonymous)
activate IS

IS   -> IS : RegisterUserCommand\nValidationBehavior (FluentValidation)\n→ уникальность email/username

IS   -> PGIS : UserManager.CreateAsync()\nINSERT AspNetUsers{Id, Email, FirstName, ...}\nINSERT AspNetUserRoles{userId, roleId="User"}

alt isSeller = true
    IS -> PGIS : UserManager.AddToRoleAsync("Seller")\nINSERT AspNetUserRoles{userId, roleId="Seller"}
end

IS   -> MQ   : <color:#6A1B9A>UserRegisteredEvent</color>\n{userId, email, displayName}

opt isSeller = true
    IS -> MQ : <color:#6A1B9A>UserBecameSellerEvent</color>\n{userId, displayName}
end

IS  --> User : 201 Created {userId}
deactivate IS

note over IS
  Оба события публикуются в одном
  handler'е — если isSeller=true,
  то UserRegisteredEvent + UserBecameSellerEvent
  публикуются сразу при регистрации,
  без участия администратора.
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Обработка UserRegisteredEvent ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

par Параллельная обработка UserRegisteredEvent
    MQ -> NS : <color:#B71C1C>consume UserRegisteredEvent</color>
    activate NS
    NS -> PGNS : INSERT UserNotificationPreferences\n{userId,\n email = event.Email,\n OrderUpdates = true,\n ReviewReplies = true,\n SystemAlerts = true,\n EmailEnabled = true, ...}
    deactivate NS

    MQ -> AS : <color:#B71C1C>UserRegisteredEvent</color>\n→ PlatformDailySummary.NewRegistrations++
end

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Обработка UserBecameSellerEvent (если isSeller = true) ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

par Параллельная обработка UserBecameSellerEvent
    MQ -> CS : <color:#B71C1C>consume UserBecameSellerEvent</color>
    activate CS
    CS -> PGCS : INSERT SellerReadModels\n{sellerId = userId,\n displayName,\n avatarUrl = null,\n averageRating = 0,\n reviewCount = 0,\n lastSyncedAt = now}
    note over PGCS
      CatalogService хранит локальную
      копию данных продавца, чтобы
      показывать имя и рейтинг на карточке
      товара без HTTP-запроса в Identity.
    end note
    deactivate CS

    MQ -> NS : <color:#B71C1C>consume UserBecameSellerEvent</color>
    activate NS
    NS -> PGNS : INSERT Notification\n{userId, type=SellerActivated,\n title="Аккаунт продавца активирован",\n body="Добро пожаловать! ...",\n channel=InApp}
    NS -> NS   : email (CanEmailSystem)?\n→ SMTP via MailKit
    deactivate NS
end

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Аутентификация (OAuth2 ROPC) ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

User -> IS : POST /connect/token\n{grant_type=password,\n client_id, client_secret,\n username, password,\n scope="api offline_access"}
activate IS
IS   -> IS : Duende IdentityServer\nProfileService → загрузить claims\n(email, username, roles[])
IS  --> User : {\n  access_token: JWT (TTL 3600s),\n  refresh_token: ...,\n  token_type: Bearer\n}
deactivate IS

note over IS
  JWT claims: sub, email, username
  role[] = ["User"] или ["User","Seller"]
  Валидируется Gateway и каждым
  сервисом независимо.
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Обновление профиля продавца ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

User -> GW  : PUT /api/identity/user-profiles/me\n{firstName, lastName, avatarUrl?}
GW   -> IS  : Auth JWT (Seller)
activate IS
IS   -> PGIS : UPDATE AspNetUsers{FirstName, LastName}
IS   -> MQ   : <color:#6A1B9A>UserProfileUpdatedEvent</color>\n{userId, displayName, avatarUrl}
IS  --> User : 200 UserProfileDto
deactivate IS

MQ -> CS : <color:#B71C1C>consume UserProfileUpdatedEvent</color>\n→ UPDATE SellerReadModels\n   SET DisplayName = newName,\n       AvatarUrl = newAvatar,\n       LastSyncedAt = now

@enduml
